WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:57.680
BEASTLY GIRL

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:18.640
I'm shut up in this non-place.

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:25.320
I died because of you.

00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:27.920
&lt;i&gt;Yugo!&lt;/i&gt;

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:30.840
&lt;i&gt;Yugo!&lt;/i&gt;

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:34.400
Maybe you can tell us
what we're supposed to do now.

00:01:34.480 --> 00:01:38.400
Everyone has lost it.
I can't get anything out of them except:

00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:41.520
"We'll talk about it later",
or "Go ask Yugo."

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:52.320
I don't know, Elely.
I need a little more time.

00:01:53.240 --> 00:01:57.720
I've already given you an hour!
My mom and my brother are waiting for us!

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:02.640
I don't believe it! Papa?

00:02:03.320 --> 00:02:05.000
I said later, Elely.

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:08.360
Dally, I think you should look up.

00:02:09.760 --> 00:02:11.760
Don't you start too, Rubi.

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:22.960
Don't "later" me, you waste of space!
I don't care about the others,

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:24.840
You're not allowed to give up.

00:02:24.920 --> 00:02:27.680
Now let's go and save Mama and Flopin...
now!

00:02:27.760 --> 00:02:31.000
I don't know what owl-face said,
but it doesn't matter.

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:34.080
You're an Iop
and Iops don't think, they act!

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:36.760
Iops can overcome any challenge.

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:38.360
Are you an Iop or not?

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:41.040
Are you an Iop or not?

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:43.960
-I'm an Iop!
-Good.

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:47.640
Because while you guys
were all sniffling like princesses...

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:50.720
...I was trying to open the door
to the tower.

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:51.800
And guess what?

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:55.240
We're out of luck. It's jammed shut.

00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:57.040
Want to bet?

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:02.240
-Ready, Rubi?
-Always, buddy.

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:21.880
It's pretty solid.

00:03:26.240 --> 00:03:27.600
Stop it, Dally.

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:43.360
Can't you see it's no use?

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:49.520
When he's in this state,
nothing can stop him, Amalia.

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:50.920
What an Iopbrain!

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:53.360
At least he's doing something.

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:08.160
Can't we take a little break?

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:23.720
We're not going to force that door open,
Dally. There has to be another way in.

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:25.880
Finally, some common sense.

00:04:28.840 --> 00:04:31.960
Yugo's right,
there's some kind of puzzle to solve.

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:36.400
Why else would two big clocks
be on the door?

00:04:46.480 --> 00:04:49.200
I don't know how
I didn't notice it before!

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:52.560
This door is made of silver,
very special silver.

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:56.400
-Pure.
-What's got into him?

00:04:56.480 --> 00:05:00.560
The plinth is made of palladium,
but it's encrusted with diamond powder.

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:02.800
Fascinating.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:06.840
Well, it looks like
Ruel's getting into this.

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:07.920
I'll say.

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:12.320
What a delight!

00:05:13.800 --> 00:05:16.360
Naturally, gold for the handles.

00:05:16.440 --> 00:05:18.800
That's nice, Ruel, but how do we get in?

00:05:21.600 --> 00:05:24.160
No keyhole, no need for a key.

00:05:24.240 --> 00:05:26.480
There must be a mechanism.

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:33.960
And these can't just be for decoration.

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:38.600
There's a one on the first one
and a two on the second.

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:42.240
Female intuition, coming through.

00:05:51.840 --> 00:05:54.600
See? That wasn't so hard. Who's the best?

00:05:55.520 --> 00:05:56.400
Amalia!

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:06.600
Amalia!

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:10.760
She's been completely pulverized.

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:13.200
Not quite. Look there!

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:19.880
You owe me again, Amalia.

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:26.600
You're always there when I need you.

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:31.920
Oh, they're in love!

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:37.000
Move aside, lovebirds,

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:38.960
I think I've got it.

00:06:39.520 --> 00:06:45.120
Only twice a day, all the ones
and all the twos are lined up.

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:48.520
Morning, at 11:11...

00:06:51.320 --> 00:06:53.400
And at 22:22.

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:16.240
Well done, Ruel.
You've made yourself useful for once.

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:24.280
I promise I'll come back and see you
when all this is over.

00:07:24.360 --> 00:07:27.440
For now, my darling, my duty calls.

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:41.640
That smell... Ugh!

00:07:41.720 --> 00:07:45.080
-It stinks worse than Ruel's feet.
-Well, almost.

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:49.800
I see my usefulness
has been forgotten already.

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:53.600
And I've got an old saying for you, Dally:

00:07:53.680 --> 00:07:57.480
"Before you laugh at others,
make sure your own teeth are white."

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:10.440
My teeth are just fine!

00:08:12.400 --> 00:08:15.000
Your foot just made a funny noise, Papa.

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:17.840
It's...

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:23.160
It's not the noise I'm worried about.

00:08:44.680 --> 00:08:46.040
There! That's...

00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:50.240
Count Harebourg. He must have
done something to annoy Oropo.

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:56.680
No! It's...

00:08:56.760 --> 00:08:58.360
It's a nightmare!

00:08:58.440 --> 00:09:00.400
It's just a little poop!

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:05.560
Poop!

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:08.200
It's everywhere! This place is a pigsty!

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:11.720
Your legend will never survive this, Papa.

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:15.320
Now I won't be the only one here
with stinky feet.

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:18.280
No. No!

00:09:18.920 --> 00:09:21.360
No!

00:09:27.320 --> 00:09:29.200
Look! I'll follow them.

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:31.440
Wait, Yugo, we can't get separated.

00:09:34.360 --> 00:09:37.440
No! This can't happen to a princess!

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:41.440
What are you doing, Papa?

00:09:41.520 --> 00:09:43.280
Don't be such a baby.

00:09:43.360 --> 00:09:45.240
Everything will be fine!

00:09:45.320 --> 00:09:47.120
You... You promise?

00:09:50.560 --> 00:09:53.680
I've already lost one foot
in this battle, Elely.

00:10:37.480 --> 00:10:40.360
You must be starving.
Please, eat something.

00:10:43.600 --> 00:10:46.840
Wait, Flopin.
I don't see any reason to trust you.

00:10:52.600 --> 00:10:54.920
I understand that you are wary.

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:57.080
You probably will be for some time.

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:11.560
There is divine blood
in your children's veins, Evangelyne.

00:11:11.640 --> 00:11:14.760
They're the first
to have received a proper education.

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:18.760
All other members of our brotherhood
are orphans.

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:27.600
At least this door isn't booby-trapped.

00:11:28.160 --> 00:11:30.160
Find anything?

00:11:30.240 --> 00:11:34.120
Not really. I just followed
a group of frogs and they opened it.

00:11:35.400 --> 00:11:40.160
Wood and stone? This thing has nothing
on that little beauty downstairs.

00:11:41.320 --> 00:11:43.320
If we want to find Eva and Flopin,

00:11:43.400 --> 00:11:46.120
we need to get
to the top of this tower quickly.

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:48.600
What an outstanding deduction!

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:50.080
That's exactly right.

00:11:51.280 --> 00:11:52.680
Don't be strangers, now.

00:11:53.160 --> 00:11:54.240
Come on in.

00:11:55.760 --> 00:11:58.720
Wait! That was a little girl's voice.

00:11:58.800 --> 00:12:00.280
This'll be easy!

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:01.480
Elely, wait!

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:30.960
Good boy, Cancan, good boy.

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:32.440
You did a good job.

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:39.160
My name is Mishell.
I was in such a hurry to meet you,

00:12:39.240 --> 00:12:41.240
I sent my Bogart looking for you.

00:12:41.800 --> 00:12:44.960
Well, your Bogart is a big slob
and he attacked our feet!

00:12:48.520 --> 00:12:53.760
The mighty Percedal, defeated by a poop!
They don't make heroes like they used to.

00:12:54.400 --> 00:12:56.000
You know who we are?

00:12:56.080 --> 00:12:57.920
Of course I do, Elely.

00:12:58.000 --> 00:13:01.960
We're always talking about you guys here,
especially... you!

00:13:02.040 --> 00:13:03.000
Me?

00:13:04.040 --> 00:13:07.040
Oropo thinks you'll make
an excellent Iop goddess.

00:13:10.320 --> 00:13:13.640
That's the only reason
he hasn't beaten you all to a pulp.

00:13:14.360 --> 00:13:16.560
He's trying to convince you.

00:13:16.640 --> 00:13:20.920
If he wants to convince me of anything,
he'd free my mom and my brother.

00:13:21.560 --> 00:13:24.280
You still have plenty of doubts,
like I did.

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:26.720
You'll soon see Oropo isn't our enemy.

00:13:26.800 --> 00:13:29.480
On the contrary, he's our savior.

00:13:29.560 --> 00:13:31.520
Our savior? That's a bit much.

00:13:31.600 --> 00:13:33.160
It's the truth, though!

00:13:33.240 --> 00:13:35.240
We don't have time to play around!

00:14:14.960 --> 00:14:17.480
I've got a bad feeling about this, guys.

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:18.880
Mishell!

00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:23.320
I don't know what you want,
but we want to save our friends.

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:27.760
Every minute we waste increases
the chance that they're in trouble.

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:32.280
Adamai and Oropo
have told us a lot about you, Yugo,

00:14:32.360 --> 00:14:36.320
about your great bursts of heroics
that put everyone in danger.

00:14:37.320 --> 00:14:40.400
Your friends are fine.
Our leader is not a murderer.

00:14:41.320 --> 00:14:44.200
As for what I want from you,
honestly, not much.

00:14:45.120 --> 00:14:47.840
Oropo asked me to test you,
so I'm testing you.

00:14:47.920 --> 00:14:49.920
If you succeed, you may continue.

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:52.800
If not, you'll stay here
with me and my friends!

00:14:58.160 --> 00:14:59.880
Too slow, portal master.

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:07.440
I've never seen anyone react so quickly.

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:09.960
Don't be fooled by appearances.

00:15:10.040 --> 00:15:13.840
Like Elely, I'm the daughter of a god,
the god Osamodas!

00:15:14.920 --> 00:15:16.680
I don't believe this.

00:15:16.760 --> 00:15:20.640
There are demigods in every nook
and cranny of this blasted tower.

00:15:21.240 --> 00:15:25.880
Let's get a move on. All we need to do
is get to the other side. I'll create...

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:29.920
I didn't catch that last bit.

00:15:34.440 --> 00:15:37.880
Are you okay, Yugo?
Why are you looking at me like that?

00:15:44.120 --> 00:15:45.760
There's plenty to go round.

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:53.240
You, too, old man.

00:15:56.800 --> 00:15:58.320
Nice work again, Papa!

00:15:58.400 --> 00:16:01.240
Congratulations, kid!
You touched our heads!

00:16:01.320 --> 00:16:05.440
Unless you want a good spanking,
tell that ugly pet of yours to...

00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:14.720
Unless my ears are mistaken,

00:16:14.800 --> 00:16:17.560
it sounds like you
are the temple's new Tofus!

00:16:25.760 --> 00:16:26.680
Papa!

00:16:28.640 --> 00:16:30.440
You turned them into Tofus!

00:16:30.520 --> 00:16:33.440
Just for a few minutes.
I wanted time to talk to you.

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:39.720
Follow me, I want to show you something.
They can join us when they change back.

00:16:41.920 --> 00:16:44.360
Be good, little Tofus. I'll see you soon.

00:18:14.040 --> 00:18:18.760
So, what's the big plan? You're going
to try to convince me you're good guys?

00:18:19.400 --> 00:18:24.680
Nope, that's Oropo's job. I'll tell you
my story and you decide what you think.

00:18:25.320 --> 00:18:27.960
You mean
we're not going to fight each other?

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:29.040
No.

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:30.920
Not even a little slap?

00:18:31.720 --> 00:18:33.840
You'll make a perfect Iop goddess.

00:18:50.160 --> 00:18:52.640
Elely, I'll be honest with you.

00:18:55.040 --> 00:18:58.560
I hate violence,
especially against animals.

00:19:03.880 --> 00:19:05.520
I want to change things.

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:12.800
I want to wake up my friends!

00:20:06.880 --> 00:20:09.520
I'm not here to convince you
of anything, Elely.

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:12.600
I think Oropo is right about one thing.

00:20:12.680 --> 00:20:15.040
The gods aren't doing their jobs right.

00:20:15.120 --> 00:20:18.680
And you want to do it instead?
Do you think you're good enough?

00:20:20.400 --> 00:20:23.760
They live like kings,
hiding away in their divine dimensions,

00:20:23.840 --> 00:20:26.640
without a care in the world,
especially not for us.

00:20:27.960 --> 00:20:31.560
-My dad used to be the Iop god and--
-And he quit, didn't he?

00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:42.360
-He didn't even know he was the Iop god.
-Hey, pipsqueak!

00:20:42.440 --> 00:20:46.880
-You'll regret treating us like that!
-Stop it, Papa. She means us no harm.

00:20:46.960 --> 00:20:51.000
Yeah, you're not the one who almost
got swallowed whole by Big Blue.

00:20:52.440 --> 00:20:55.000
It looks like your stay here is over.

00:20:55.600 --> 00:20:59.200
Yeah, except it's not you who's
kicking us out! We're leaving.

00:21:00.680 --> 00:21:03.040
Elely, don't forget what I told you.

00:21:03.120 --> 00:21:06.680
Oropo thought that you could become
a great Iop goddess.

00:21:08.600 --> 00:21:12.400
Well, Elely will wait till she's 18
before she becomes a goddess.

00:21:21.480 --> 00:21:25.760
I don't know what makes you trust Oropo,
but you should keep your distance.

00:21:26.320 --> 00:21:29.440
And you should really join us.
You'll understand soon.

00:21:33.240 --> 00:21:34.320
Elely!

00:21:35.240 --> 00:21:37.240
Be careful on the next level up.

00:21:37.320 --> 00:21:39.400
The tenant gets a little hot-headed.

